# SecRecorder secrets for the macOS eval target. Copy to secrets.env (gitignored) and fill in;
# `secdeploy deploy macos --tls` reads it automatically. A --hf-token flag overrides this.
#
# Diarization (optional) needs a Hugging Face token with the gated model's conditions accepted:
#   1. Accept https://huggingface.co/pyannote/speaker-diarization-community-1
#   2. Create a read token at https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
HF_TOKEN=
